{"2939080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghost Kickers!", "steam_appid": 2939080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Kickers! is a top-down action-adventure in which you explore a mysterious island in search of missing exorcists. Defeat evil yokai and claim their powers to free a fantastical land - inspired by Japanese myths and legends - of its curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single-Player Story <br>A grand adventure across the cursed island of Seraiken, filled with ruins and long-lost places. Visit the sacred remains of the order - a place of rest and a gathering ground for lost souls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hundred-Storied Pagoda <br>It awaits those who seek the ultimate challenge, as each floor grows harder and deadlier. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer Arena <br>Challenge friends and rivals, on the same screen or online, and choose from a selection of legendary exorcists. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Map Designer  <br>Create, customize, and share your own maps with a global community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939080/extras/90fe1933d71759cec45a27f5d88be79f.avif?t=1770591111\" width=460 height=370 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless adventures await - in Ghost Kickers!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Kickers! is a top-down action-adventure in which you explore a mysterious island in search of missing exorcists. Defeat evil yokai and claim their powers to free a fantastical land - inspired by Japanese myths and legends - of its curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><